{"id":"wb-6-703","name":"广德寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"广德寺 (遂宁)","text":"广德寺，原名石佛寺，位于四川省遂宁市城西三里许的卧龙山首处，1996年9月16日公布为四川省第四批省级文物保护单位，2006年5月25日列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n寺始建于唐朝年间，原名石佛寺。大历二年更名为“保唐寺”。大历十三年敕名“禅林寺”，德宗建中初年敕名“善济寺”。昭宗天复三年敕名“再兴禅林寺”，北宋真宗祥符四年敕名“广利禅寺”。明武宗正德年间敕赐“广德寺”。至今已1200余年。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%BF%E5%BE%B7%E5%AF%BA_(%E9%81%82%E5%AE%81)","revisionId":76594113,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=76594113","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f799596cb6c24926ae7f57f2.jpg","title":"广德寺_大雄宝殿.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B9%BF%E5%BE%B7%E5%AF%BA_%E5%A4%A7%E9%9B%84%E5%AE%9D%E6%AE%BF.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/%E5%B9%BF%E5%BE%B7%E5%AF%BA_%E5%A4%A7%E9%9B%84%E5%AE%9D%E6%AE%BF.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Principal hall of Guangde Temple (Suining)","width":320,"height":217}}